78
00:04:30,159 --> 00:04:33,079
Like what drug is that patient on, how are they responding,

79
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:35,319
what's their longitudinal journey.

80
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:39,040
It wasn't being matched with other key data sets like pathology slides or

81
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,439
