97
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:38,000
The network effects that result from these two is pretty profound.

98
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,800
The more patients we sequence, the more data we collect,

99
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:43,759
which allows us to provide additional insights, further enhancing our

100
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:46,639
businesses, and allowing us to collect more data.

101
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:50,680
That flywheel that began to kind of turn six or

102
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:54,720
seven years ago is now in full flight.

103
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,399
And as you can see, we're not just collecting some data,

104
00:05:57,399 --> 00:06:01,600
we're really collecting the totality of data that's necessary to figure out if

105
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:04,920
the patient's on the right drug or the right trial or

106
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,800
how I would advance drug discovery development.

107
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,720
If you think about the problem that we have been solving for

108
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:14,680
