111
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:28,200
So we will continue to amass a lot of data over the next several years

112
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:32,599
as we really try to get a significant percentage of the US market,

113
00:06:32,599 --> 00:06:33,959
