116
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:44,959
And to make sense of the data, you need a platform that is sustainable.

117
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:47,399
You have to be able to invest in harmonizing and structuring and

118
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:50,360
making sense of this data and generating insights.

119
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,800
So we effectively had to clear two hurdles.

120
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,319
We had to find a way to amass lots of data and

121
00:06:55,319 --> 00:06:58,159
